---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout 
  title="Home | Headway Northumberland"
  description="Supporting people living with acquired brain injury at drop-ins across Northumberland."
>
  <section class="hero-banner">
    <div class="hero-content">
	    <h1 class="hero-heading">
        We support people living with acquired brain injury at drop-ins across Northumberland including in Hexham, Alnwick, Berwick, Morpeth and Ashington
      </h1>
      <a href="#schedule" class="cta-button">Check When We Meet</a>
	  </div>
  </section>

<section>
  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2>Community Neuro Hubs</h2>
    <p>Clearer Futures Community Neuro Hubs (and other activities) for people with Acquired and Traumatic Brain Injuries, Stroke Survivors, and other Neurological Conditions.</p>
  </div>
    <h3 id="schedule" class="schedule-title">Where and when we usually meet:</h3>
      
  <ul class="card-list">
        
    <li class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <strong>Hexham</strong>
        <span class="card-accent">Every Wednesday, 11am–1pm</span>
      </div>
        <p class="card-footer">Adapt (North East) Community Hub, Burn Lane, Hexham, NE46 3HN</p>
    </li>

    <li class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <strong>Alnwick</strong>
        <span class="card-accent">3rd Friday of every month, 11am–1pm</span>
      </div>
        <p class="card-footer">Weavers Court, Swordy Drive, Alnwick NE66 1SZ</p>
    </li>

    <li class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <strong>Berwick</strong>
        <span class="card-accent">2nd Monday of every month, 10am–12pm</span>
      </div>
        <p class="card-footer">Northern View Community Centre, Spittal, Berwick upon Tweed TD15 2JU</p>
    </li>

    <li class="card">
      <div class="card-header">
        <strong>Morpeth</strong>
        <span class="card-accent">Last Thursday of every month, 10:30am–12pm</span>
      </div>
        <p class="card-footer">Electrical Wizard, Wetherspoons, 11 New Market, Morpeth NE61 1PS</p>
    </li>

  </ul>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2> Everyone is welcome to all sessions.</h2>
      <p>Neuro Hubs are delivered in partnership with Brainbox through Clearer Futures Neuro Hub.</p>
      <p>Please note that the Ashington Neuro Hubs are merging with the Morpeth Neuro Hubs.</p>
      <p>Please contact Lynn Jones, Chairperson and Trustee on <strong>01670 788 397</strong> or Trustee and Volunteer David Howcroft on <strong>01670 511 687</strong> for more details.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<hr class="divider-full"/>

<section>
  <div class="prose-container">
    <h2>National Support</h2>
    <p>Headway is a UK-wide charity that works to improve life after brain injury by providing vital support and information services, including:</p>
    <p>Freephone helpline on <a href="tel:08088002244" class="text-link">0808 800 2244</a> or at <a href="mailto:helpline@headway.org.uk" class="text-link"> helpline@headway.org.uk</a></p>
    <p>Comprehensive website containing information and factsheets on all aspects of brain injury at <a href="https://www.headway.org.uk" class="text-link"> www.headway.org.uk</a></p>
    <p>Award-winning range of <a href="https://www.headway.org.uk/about-brain-injury/individuals/information-library/" class="text-link">booklets and publications</a> designed to help people understand and cope with the effects of brain injury</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.headway.org.uk/supporting-you/headway-emergency-fund/" class="text-link">Emergency fund</a> to assist people dealing with the financial implications in the immediate aftermath of a brain injury.</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.headway.org.uk/supporting-you/brain-injury-identity-card/" class="text-link">Brain Injury Identity Card</a> to help in everyday situations and if you come into contact with the criminal justice system</p>
    <p><a href="https://www.headway.org.uk/supporting-you/in-your-area/approved-care-providers/" class="text-link">Directory</a> of approved residential homes, rehabilitation units and respite facilities specialising in Acquired Brain Injury (ABI)</p>
    <p>For more information on the above services go to <a href="mailto:helpline@headway.org.uk" class="text-link"> helpline@headway.org.uk</a> or call the Helpline on <a href="tel:08088002244" class="text-link">0808 800 2244</a>.</p>
    <p>Headway also lobbies for better support and resources to be made available to people affected by brain injury and works to raise awareness of brain injury and the devastating effects it can have.</p>
  </div>
</section>

</BaseLayout>